{
  "flux-3-image character": "A courier in her twenties in a yellow raincoat, black boots and a grey messenger bag, shown in three full-body views of the same character side by side: the front view on the left, the side profile in the middle and the back view on the right. Standing in a neutral pose with the arms relaxed at the sides. A wide landscape frame, the camera straight-on at mid-body height, the whole figure in each view with space above the head and below the feet, a soft contact shadow under each view. Soft, even studio light from the front, the shadows faint and diffuse. The background is plain, even light grey and unmarked. Flat cel-shaded animation.",
  "flux-3-image character + refs": "Image 1 supplies the character to show and image 2 supplies a style reference, used only for its colour palette and the colour of its light. A courier in her twenties in a yellow raincoat, black boots and a grey messenger bag, shown in three full-body views of the same character side by side: the front view on the left, the side profile in the middle and the back view on the right. Standing in a neutral pose with the arms relaxed at the sides. A wide landscape frame, the camera straight-on at mid-body height, the whole figure in each view with space above the head and below the feet, a soft contact shadow under each view. Soft, even studio light from the front, the shadows faint and diffuse. The background is plain, even light grey and unmarked. Flat cel-shaded animation. Keep the face, hair, build and clothing of the character from image 1. Take only the colour palette from image 2.",
  "flux-3-image environment": "A rain-soaked pedestrian crossing in a city centre. The place is empty of people and every surface is unlettered. A wide landscape frame, the camera at eye level, about 1.6 m above the ground. Blue dusk light after rain, wet asphalt reflecting the street lamps.",
